List all bundles stored in a centralized pool.

Displays a table of all bundles with their checksums, titles, authors,
and creation dates. Bundles are sorted alphabetically by title. Checksums are
shortened in the table; use -f to show them in full.

Examples:
  # List bundles in default pool
  bundle list_bundles

  # List bundles in specific pool
  bundle list_bundles --pool backup

  # List with full checksums
  bundle list_bundles -f

  # List with JSON output
  bundle list_bundles --json

Configuration:
  Pools are configured in ~/.config/bundle/config.yaml:

  pools:
    default:
      root: /mnt/bundles
      title: Default Bundle Pool

Remote:
  # List bundles on a server, which always shows full checksums
  bundle list_bundles --remote origin --remote-pool archive
